  "goodToKnow": "Der Kontostand is an account balance: den Kontostand abfragen, ein Kontostand im Minus (overdrawn). German banks offer a Dispositionskredit (Dispo), an overdraft, often with high interest. Statements are der Kontoauszug, and transfers are Überweisungen. Das Konto is the account. Plural: die Kontostände."
